title: '2026-11-14: the pacer now checks Jeff''s files after every session, and sessions can say what they hold; committed on main in four commits, 3b76c864 to 9a743d44.'
pid: 78773de6-bb38-4ce5-97d6-8e5aec3e03b4
body: |2-
  Both pieces are built, and installed by renaming over the running
  pacer, so they take effect when you start it again. How each works,
  and where its files are, is in my "what I know".
